        "content": "## T01 - Webhook to Database\n`POST /webhook/t01-orders` with header `X-Lab-Key: <LAB_WEBHOOK_KEY>`.\n\n- bad schema -> **400** with every error listed\n- replayed `external_id` -> **200** `{duplicate:true}` (P03, Redis, 24 h)\n- new event -> row in `webhook_events` -> **201** with the row id\n\nFailures anywhere -> P01 error handler.",
